| !SSHd - SSH server for RISC OS: a Wimp task with an icon-bar icon.
| Settings live in <Choices$Write>.SSHd.Options (see !Help), not here:
| PackMan replaces this file on every upgrade.
Set SSHd$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <SSHd$Dir>.!Sprites
| CryptRandom is not in the ROM; PackMan installs it as System:Modules.CryptRand.
| Missing modules are reported by the server in its log window, not with an
| error box, so that running !SSHd from the boot sequence never stalls it.
RMEnsure CryptRandom 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.CryptRand
IfThere <Choices$Write>.SSHd Then Else CDir <Choices$Write>.SSHd
| UnixLib: no filename suffix swapping, keep our RISC OS paths as they are
Set UnixEnv$sshd$sfix ""
WimpSlot -min 2048K -max 2048K
Run <SSHd$Dir>.sshd -d <Choices$Write>.SSHd -r <Boot$Dir>.^ %*0
